#. type: paragraph
#: options.yo:1
msgid ""
"This paragraph is not split by the center(centered text) macro anymore, "
"because the center macro was demoted to an inline macro by the inline "
"option."
msgstr ""
"THIS PARAGRAPH IS NOT SPLIT BY THE CENTER(CENTERED TEXT) MACRO ANYMORE, "
"BECAUSE THE CENTER MACRO WAS DEMOTED TO AN INLINE MACRO BY THE INLINE "
"OPTION."

#. type: myblock
#: options.yo:4
msgid "First argument, which contains a comma"
msgstr "FIRST ARGUMENT, WHICH CONTAINS A COMMA"

#. type: paragraph
#: options.yo:6
msgid "Text around the"
msgstr "TEXT AROUND THE"

#. type: myblock
#: options.yo:6
msgid "macro configured as a block macro"
msgstr "MACRO CONFIGURED AS A BLOCK MACRO"

#. type: paragraph
#: options.yo:6
msgid "call."
msgstr "CALL."

#. type: paragraph
#: options.yo:8
msgid ""
"The verb(verbatim) macro is inline too, so its content stays inside the "
"surrounding sentence and is translated along with it."
msgstr ""
"THE VERB(VERBATIM) MACRO IS INLINE TOO, SO ITS CONTENT STAYS INSIDE THE "
"SURROUNDING SENTENCE AND IS TRANSLATED ALONG WITH IT."

#. type: paragraph
#: options.yo:11
msgid "The"
msgstr "THE"

#. type: paragraph
#: options.yo:11
msgid ""
"macro is untranslated here, so it splits the surrounding text and its "
"argument is not a message of its own."
msgstr ""
"MACRO IS UNTRANSLATED HERE, SO IT SPLITS THE SURROUNDING TEXT AND ITS "
"ARGUMENT IS NOT A MESSAGE OF ITS OWN."
